    "Solo orderer will be implemented as a new consensus plugin (though it requires no consensus).",
    "State cache will be integrated in the peer's ledger package with configurable size.",
    "CLI extraction will use gRPC to communicate with peer/orderer, and installation packages will be created for Linux, Mac, Windows.",
